# Mach-O export list for libfuse-abi.dylib (docs/dev/abi-design.md, point 1).
# See exported_symbols.map's header comment for why this is needed in
# addition to -fvisibility=hidden: this library statically links every
# fuse:: layer down to Kokkos and fmt, none of which was compiled with
# hidden visibility, and ld64's default behaviour is to re-export every
# defined symbol it pulls in. test/abi/exported_symbols.golden and the
# `abi.exported_symbols` ctest assert the result of this list is exactly
# one line. Ported from upstream/karma/src/abi/karma_exports.sym, which
# solves the identical problem for libkarma_abi.
_fuse_coupler_abi
